  "title": "Creamy Creamed Cabbage",
  "description": "Enjoy sauce for cabbage with this recipe for cabbage leaves baked with a creamy white sauce and Romano cheese in this delicious method of preparing an old vegetable favorite.",
  "authors": [
    "Michele O'Sullivan"
  ],
